        "entry_RwTnhe": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "How do I use the mulch plug?",
            "text": "<p>Your LawnMaster MX 48V 41cm Cordless Mower comes supplied with a mulching plug for when you want to deposit the grass clippings back onto the lawn to act as a nutrient, rather than collect in the grass bag.</p><p><strong>To install the mulching plug</strong>:<br/>1. Lift the deflector guard and detach the grass collection bag.</p><p><br/>2. Lift and hold the deflector guard up with one hand.</p><p><br/>3. With other hand grasp the mulching plug by its upright handle and insert the plug into the rear discharge chute. Ensure that the locking latch snaps into place.</p><p><br/>4. Release the deflector guard back into position during mowing.</p>",
